meta {
  name: LxxPrefill
  type: http
  seq: 23
}

post {
  url: {{url}}maintainer/lxx/prefill
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  LXX pass 1 (roadmap 0028.6) in the background: an LXX word whose normalized form occurs in the NT with exactly one (lemma, Strong's, morphology) gets it as a proposal (status proposed, source nt-form, no user). Never touches confirmed, ai or human rows; a second run changes nothing. 202 with the job (the log lists coverage per book); 409 while another seed or LXX job runs; 401 anonymous; 403 other roles. Poll LxxStatus.
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}
